  "html": "\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"80%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"80\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/know_h.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"500\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:80/500\" usemap=\"#know_h\" width=\"80\"></font></p></td>\n<td nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"670%\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"3\"><b>비밀통로에 대해 알아보자</b></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"teal\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><b>[Written By Forg]</b></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">해당지역으로 대충가셔셔 자세히 조사하시길</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">캐릭이 바로보는방향으로 \n            한칸움직이시면 됩니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp; </font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"blue\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><b>Buccaneer's Den의 지하통로</b></font><font color=\"blue\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"> </font>\n</p><table border=\"\" width=\"60%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/tip/hidden.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"312\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:340/312\" width=\"340\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/tip/hidden17.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"312\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:340/312\" width=\"340\"></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">부케의 지하통로</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">바로 밑으로 \n                        내려왔을 때장면입니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">이동하시다보시면 \n                        위로 </font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">텔레 포트할 \n                        수 있는장소가..</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"fuchsia\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><b>미르의 비밀통로</b></font><font color=\"fuchsia\" face=\"바탕체\"> </font>\n</p><table border=\"\" width=\"60%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/tip/hidden1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"312\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:340/312\" width=\"340\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/tip/hidden2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"312\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:340/312\" width=\"340\"></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">미르의비밀통로</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">[안으로들어가시면 \n                        쇠창살이있는데 마우스2번클릭]</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">밝게 빛나는 \n                        곳으로 향하시면 탑의 옥상으로</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">가실수 있고 \n                        데몬이 밑에서 출현합니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">데몬과 자신사이에 \n                        어떠한 공격도 안됩니다</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"blue\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><b>트린식서쪽의 히든벨리</b></font><font color=\"blue\" face=\"바탕체\"> </font>\n</p><table border=\"\" width=\"60%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/tip/hidden3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"312\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:340/312\" width=\"340\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/tip/hidden4.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"312\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:340/312\" width=\"340\"></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">트린식 히든벨리로 \n                        울온 전체맵을 보시면 트린식좌측에</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">이계곡이 보입니다 \n                        근처까지 오셔셔 찿아보시길</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"479\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">안으로 들어가보시면 \n                        또다른 비밀통로가 있습니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">하단 탑의 지하로들어가실수있는텔레포트장소</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"fuchsia\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><b>테라산의 스타룸</b></font><font color=\"fuchsia\" face=\"바탕체\"> </font>\n</p><table border=\"\" width=\"60%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"519\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/tip/hidden8.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"312\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:376/312\" width=\"376\"></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"247\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/tip/hidden10.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"312\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:340/312\" width=\"340\"></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"519\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">테라산의 바론방에 \n                        앞쪽에 있는 </font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">유명한 분수대를 \n                        다 아실겁니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">그 분수대에서 \n                        west방면쪽으로 쭉 가시다보면 </font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">화면상의 지도가 \n                        나옵니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">사진에 보이는 \n                        횃불을 마구클릭하시면</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#545454\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">텔레포트하시게 \n                        됩니다.</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"247\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#636363\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">보이는 이곳이 \n                        스타룸-\"- </font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/rare/musics.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"42\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/42\" width=\"16\"></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"74\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"바탕체\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"676\"><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"바탕체\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\">&nbsp;</font></p><map name=\"know_h\">\n<area coords=\"1, 63, 78, 80\" href=\"/site/house_a/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 82, 78, 100\" href=\"/site/house_add/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 102, 77, 120\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124201800/http://forg.co.kr/house_f.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 122, 77, 140\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124201800/http://forg.co.kr/fame.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 142, 77, 160\" href=\"/site/m_weapon/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 162, 77, 181\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124201800/http://forg.co.kr/rare.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 183, 77, 202\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124201800/http://forg.co.kr/g_stone.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 204, 77, 221\" href=\"/site/runebook/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 223, 77, 241\" href=\"/site/s_p/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 243, 78, 262\" href=\"/site/com/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 264, 78, 281\" href=\"/site/mirc/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 284, 76, 300\" href=\"/site/uosu/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"45, 466, 60, 478\" href=\"/site/knowhow/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"62, 466, 77, 478\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124201800/http://forg.co.kr/knowhow_1.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n</map>\n",
